  "description": "Transform Your Lash Routine with Our New Pre-Glued Lash Kit Elevate your look with our premium Pre-Glued Lash Kit, designed to give you flawless lashes effortlessly. This all-in-one kit includes everything you need for a seamless application, perfect for beauty lovers of all skill levels. What’s Inside: ✨ 1 x Set of 5-row pre-glued cluster lashes (choose your perfect style) ✨ 1 x Stick and Clamp patented applicator system for precision application ✨ 1 x Spoolie brush to blend lashes for a natural finish Your Choice of Lash Style: Subtle Volume Soft Classic Satin Volume Soft Definition Soft Wisp Feathered Subtle Tapered Defined Feathered Volume Wispy Volume Cocoa (Dark brown) Light Cocoa (Light brown) LWI Classic LWI Wispy Classic LWI Hybrid LWI Fluffy Hybrid LWI Russian Volume What Makes Our Pre-Glued Lashes Special: Our Pre-Glued Lashes are crafted with our revolutionary Ela-stick™ technology , offering up to 5-10 days of wear . They're waterproof, showerproof, and windproof , so your lashes will stay stunning no matter the occasion. Vegan & Cruelty-Free: We are committed to conscious beauty with hand-crafted, premium materials that are 100% vegan and cruelty-free. Satisfaction Guaranteed: Love your lashes, or get your money back—no questions asked.",
